WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.470 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  the be active education award celebrates  exemplary initiatives encouraging kids  to be active in and out of the school  environment  despite the pandemic induced challenges  munich-based sports club tsv neurid evie  came up with a fantastic idea to get  kids to move that made them worthy  winners of the 2021 be active education  award during the times of homeschooling  and reduced school sports tsv neuris  created the sport and garden sound  concept the idea was simple the club's  trainers would visit young members at  their homes to do sports over their  garden fence  kids and parents could set an  appointment for a trainer to come to  their homes for free the trainers would  bring all the equipment needed to play  various sports and engage in physical  exercise together with the kids  not only did this give the kids a break  from being in front of their electronic  devices motivating them to go outside it  also allowed them to spend time with  their favorite trainers  they could even compete against their  trainers in the neurida vet camp  competitions of neurate win small prizes  and earn a certificate what's more kids  living nearby in the neighborhood often  joined in or were invited to join making  it a community experience  the social impact of our project i think  was that we could stay active and that  we could keep our members active  everyone was closed up in their homes  and can go outside and do sports  together so it was also a socializing  event

